PN,33201
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785383017
OL,3,CSouth Asian children waiting years for
OL,4,Ca live kidney donor
OL,6,FThe families of two children from
OL,7,FBradford who needing life-saving organ
OL,8,Ftransplants are urgently appealing for
OL,9,Fmore kidney donors from South Asian
OL,10,Fcommunities.
OL,12,FTeenagers Yousaf, aged 15, and Uqbah,
OL,13,Faged 16, both need kidney transplants
OL,14,Fand spend hours every week getting
OL,15,Fdialysis at Leeds Children's Hospital.
OL,17,FUqbah has end stage kidney failure and
OL,18,Fhas been waiting for a donor match for
OL,19,Ffour years. Yousaf needs a second
OL,20,Ftransplant after his first failed
OL,21,Fnearly three years ago.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785383017
OL,3,CSouth Asian children waiting years for
OL,4,Ca live kidney donor
OL,6,FThe families have been told that
OL,7,Fsecuring a donor from their own ethnic
OL,8,Fbackground offers the best chance of a
OL,9,Fsuccessful match, however a shortage
OL,10,Fof donors from South Asian backgrounds
OL,11,Fmeans there are significant delays.
OL,13,FYousaf's health complications started
OL,14,Fat the time of birth when he was
OL,15,Fdiagnosed with posterior urethral
OL,16,Fvalves, leading to undeveloped kidneys.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785383017
OL,3,CSouth Asian children waiting years for
OL,4,Ca live kidney donor
OL,6,F"He was in my tummy when the doctor
OL,7,Fsaid he would not survive more than
OL,8,Fthree weeks after birth", said his mum
OL,9,FRehela Qados, "but he defied all odds
OL,10,Fto be here and is still keeping a
OL,11,Fbrave face after significant health
OL,12,Fstruggles."
OL,14,FHe received his first kidney
OL,15,Ftransplant as a toddler, which failed
OL,16,Fthree years ago leading to ongoing
OL,17,Fdialysis three times per week.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@XO]qD@OOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785383017
OL,3,CSouth Asian children waiting years for
OL,4,Ca live kidney donor
OL,6,FRecent complications include two
OL,7,Fpermacath lines causing blood clots, a
OL,8,Fsevere line infection, and a blood
OL,9,Fclot on his lung after line removal.
OL,11,FRehela added: "It's been over two
OL,12,Fyears since we started dialysis and I
OL,13,Fhave seen that most caucasian people,
OL,14,Feven those who came after Yousaf, have
OL,15,Ffound a match".
OL,26,@sD@OOUwD@NO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785383017
OL,3,CSouth Asian children waiting years for
OL,4,Ca live kidney donor
OL,6,FAccording to NHS Blood and Transplant,
OL,7,FNHSBT, donation figures, people of
OL,8,FSouth Asian heritage are up to five
OL,9,Ftimes more likely to develop kidney
OL,10,Ffailure than Caucasian people in the
OL,11,FUK.
OL,13,FThis, combined with lower matching
OL,14,Frates on donor registers, means Asian
OL,15,Fpatients often wait several months
OL,16,Flonger for a lifesaving kidney match.
OL,18,FUqbah is on her fourth Permath
OL,19,Fdialysis line and has been on the
OL,20,Fdonor list for the past four years.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785383017
OL,3,CSouth Asian children waiting years for
OL,4,Ca live kidney donor
OL,6,FHer mum Ummarah, said: "Dialysis is
OL,7,Fsustaining her life in this time but
OL,8,Fit is steadily taking her strength,
OL,9,Fher energy and her independence".
OL,11,FShe has been warned by the doctors
OL,12,Fthat a living kidney donor is her only
OL,13,Freal chance for life.
OL,15,FUmmarah added: "Uqbah has lived with
OL,16,Fend-stage kidney failure for over
OL,17,Fthree years, relying on frequent, four-
OL,18,Fhour dialysis sessions.
OL,26,@nD@XOUwD@POU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785383017
OL,3,CSouth Asian children waiting years for
OL,4,Ca live kidney donor
OL,6,F"Her severe learning difficulties and
OL,7,Fautism make these procedures
OL,8,Fdistressing and traumatic.
OL,10,F"The condition causes constant nausea,
OL,11,Ffrequent vomiting, and severe
OL,12,Fexhaustion, making her too weak to
OL,13,Feven respond well to treatment".
OL,15,FHow to donate:
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785383017
OL,3,CSouth Asian children waiting years for
OL,4,Ca live kidney donor
OL,6,FThough there is currently an automatic
OL,7,Fopt-in arrangement for organ donation
OL,8,Fwhen someone dies, it is family
OL,9,Fmembers who have the final say;
OL,10,Fprompting calls for people to express
OL,11,Ftheir wishes to their loved ones.
OL,13,FRecent figures from NHSBT indicate
OL,14,Fthat consent rates for asian and
OL,15,Fethnic minority organ donation are
OL,16,F32.9%, which is just over half that of
OL,17,Fwhite donors, at 63%.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G8/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785383017
OL,3,CSouth Asian children waiting years for
OL,4,Ca live kidney donor
OL,6,FMahmud Nawaz, NHS Blood and Transplant
OL,7,FOrgan Donation Ambassador for
OL,8,FYorkshire said: "Things like diabetes
OL,9,Ffor example are more prevalent in
OL,10,FSouth Asian communities so you are
OL,11,Ftwice as likely to need a transplant
OL,12,Fif you have a South Asian background,
OL,13,Fbut half as likely to say yes to organ
OL,14,Fdonation upon death."
OL,16,F"This mismatch, unfortunately due to
OL,17,Fmyths about culture or religion,
OL,18,Freally leads to a much longer wait on
OL,19,Fthe transplant list and to a greater
OL,20,Fchance of death waiting for a
OL,21,Ftransplant."
OL,26,@pD@QOUvD@UO]xD@AOU}D@LO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G9/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785383017
OL,3,CSouth Asian children waiting years for
OL,4,Ca live kidney donor
OL,6,FChaplain and Imam Siddiq Diwan, who is
OL,7,Fa former member of British Islamic
OL,8,FMedical Association, believes the
OL,9,Fdisparity in the number of South Asian
OL,10,Forgan donors comes from a lack of
OL,11,Fawareness and discussion around death
OL,12,Fin communities.
OL,14,FHe said: "Organ donation has been
OL,15,Fpoorly understood amongst the South
OL,16,FAsian community, because people don't
OL,17,Freally talk about it, until sadly,
OL,18,Fwhen some near and dear one has to go
OL,19,Fthrough the challenges of needing an
OL,20,Forgan.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G10/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785383017
OL,3,CSouth Asian children waiting years for
OL,4,Ca live kidney donor
OL,6,F"There are a variety of reasons: they
OL,7,Feither don't talk or engage with the
OL,8,Fsubject at all, or disagree on the
OL,9,Fbasis of their faith, or have concerns
OL,10,Flike it may delay the burial, or cause
OL,11,Fdisrespect to the body, and many other
OL,12,Flayers of lack of awareness - which
OL,13,Fresult in low participation.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G11/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785383017
OL,3,CSouth Asian children waiting years for
OL,4,Ca live kidney donor
OL,6,F"This is because historically when
OL,7,Forgan donation was not understood as
OL,8,Fit is now, there were religious
OL,9,Frulings that came across as that organ
OL,10,Fdonation was not permissible, just
OL,11,Fblanket. However as our understanding
OL,12,Fhas evolved, similarly the rulings
OL,13,Fhave evolved too.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G12/13
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33213
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785383017
OL,3,CSouth Asian children waiting years for
OL,4,Ca live kidney donor
OL,6,F"Because organ donation in its very
OL,7,Fessence is a gift of life, the
OL,8,Fopportunity to make such a difference
OL,9,Fto somebody else's life, it really
OL,10,Faligns with the ideals of what it
OL,11,Fmeans to be a good person so most
OL,12,FSouth Asian people, when educated,
OL,13,Fwill engage very positively to the
OL,14,Fidea of organ donation."
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G13/13
